          "id": "fd66e5fb-347a-4f9a-bcaa-48dc77fd4050",
          "memory": "User and Devon planned a pizza dinner at Luigi's on 5th Street on Friday, September 18, 2026 at 6 pm to beat the dinner rush and kick off the weekend. Both will come from the office and meet there, with Devon leaving work early, parking in back like last time, and grabbing a table if first, while User will head straight after clocking out and text when parking.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "2af50a55-c471-48d4-a7c4-b2ed174f1370",
          "memory": "User had been craving garlic knots from Luigi's on 5th Street and had not been to Luigi's in at least a month as of September 16, 2026. Devon said he was craving them too.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "51376fa2-9634-4a66-bae5-de53fac796fa",
          "memory": "Around September 16, 2026 User's boss asked User to cover Saturday morning and User said no, saying User needs an actual weekend. Devon supported the decision, saying User works too many weekends. User framed Friday pizza with Devon as a no-cooking kickoff to the weekend.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "9b09cc65-9038-405f-ae16-e661df4aa3d8",
          "memory": "Devon invited User to lunch at his mom's house on Sunday, September 20, 2026. User asked Devon to thank her and said User might come. Devon's mom makes potato salad User likes, which made User say User definitely has to come.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "66a5a050-0bcd-46e6-9d36-25711fb0a048",
          "memory": "User watched the game on the night of September 15, 2026 and screamed so loud User's cat ran off, then the cat forgave User after treats. Devon only saw highlights and said the ending was wild.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "db9baf6f-2913-4209-b049-95e57724b323",
          "memory": "User set up autopay for the electric bill around September 16, 2026 after being tired of late fees, noting it took about 5 minutes online. Devon said he forgot the electric bill last month and planned to set up autopay the next day on lunch.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "eb840c57-0e78-438b-8ec9-a96fe3d2b900",
          "memory": "On September 16, 2026 Devon had almost finished a work report except for one chart to fix, while his boss kept pinging him about it. User commiserated about hating when one small thing is left.",
          "event": "ADD"
        }
      ]
    },
